      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "tab",
      "description": "Navy header tabs; the active tab opens into the cool ground.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabs\"><span class=\"ds-tab\">Yükle</span><span class=\"ds-tab ds-on\">Kontrol</span><span class=\"ds-tab\">Şablonlar</span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{font-family:\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:4px;background:#13294b;height:54px;padding:0 12px;}.ds-tab{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:#c6d3e8;padding:0 18px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;cursor:pointer;}.ds-tab:hover{color:#fff;}.ds-tab.ds-on{background:#eef2f7;color:#13294b;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lane Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "Pill chips in timeline lanes; kontrol in yellow with pictogram.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">Kapasite Raporu</span> <span class=\"ds-chip ds-check\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 20h20z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg>Kontrol: Sicil_No emin değil</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{font-family:\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:14px;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid #8d9bb0;background:#fff;color:#15202e;}.ds-chip.ds-check{background:#f5c518;border-color:#8a6d00;color:#3d2f00;font-weight:700;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kontrol Notice",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "notice-check",
      "description": "Explains an unsure value and offers one action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-notice\"><span class=\"ds-ic\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 20h20z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span><p><b>Sicil_No emin değil</b><small>“48Z13” okundu. Öneri: 48213</small></p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-notice{font-family:\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:15px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff4c2;border:1px solid #c9a200;border-radius:6px;padding:10px 12px;color:#15202e;max-width:280px;}.ds-notice p{margin:0;}.ds-notice small{display:block;font-size:14px;color:#44526a;margin-top:2px;}.ds-ic{color:#3d2f00;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cut Markers",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "cut-tag",
      "description": "Station markers: the shape says the cut type, colour repeats it.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cuts\"><span><svg width=\"29\" height=\"29\" viewBox=\"0 0 29 29\"><circle cx=\"14.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1f5fbf\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"4.5\" height=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"15.5\" y=\"9\" width=\"4.5\" height=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"15.5\" width=\"4.5\" height=\"4.5\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg><b class=\"ds-ct\" style=\"color:#1f5fbf\">QR</b></span><span><svg width=\"29\" height=\"29\" viewBox=\"0 0 29 29\"><circle cx=\"14.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"11.5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#b45200\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3.2\"/><path d=\"M9.5 10.5h10l-3.8 4.6v4l-2.4 1.2v-5.2z\" fill=\"#b45200\"/></svg><b class=\"ds-ct\" style=\"color:#b45200\">Filtre 3</b></span><span><svg width=\"29\" height=\"29\" viewBox=\"0 0 29 29\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#b42318\"/><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2.6\"/><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2.6\"/><path d=\"M21.5 8.5 12 17M17 15.5l4.5 4.5M12 12l2 2\"/></g></svg><b class=\"ds-ct\" style=\"color:#b42318\">Elle</b></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-cuts{font-family:\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;}.ds-cuts span{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;}.ds-ct{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;background:#fff;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;}"
    },
    {
