      "refersTo": "table-row-current",
      "description": "Current row in selection wash; unsure cell in kontrol wash with focus ring.",
      "html": "<table class=\"ds-tbl\"><tr><th>Belge</th><th>Sicil_No</th><th>Durum</th></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>51408</td><td>Tamam</td></tr><tr class=\"ds-cur\"><td>41</td><td class=\"ds-ck\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 20h20z\"/><path d=\"M12 10v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg> 48Z13</td><td><span class=\"ds-tag\">Kontrol</span></td></tr></table>",
      "css": ".ds-tbl{font-family:\"Atkinson Hyperlegible Next\",\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:15px;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;background:#fff;color:#15202e;}.ds-tbl th{text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#44526a;background:#f6f8fb;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #8d9bb0;}.ds-tbl td{padding:0 12px;height:40px;border-bottom:1px solid #cdd6e2;}.ds-cur td{background:#dce9fb;}.ds-tbl td.ds-ck{background:#fff4c2;color:#3d2f00;font-weight:600;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #0b5cd5;}.ds-tag{background:#f5c518;color:#3d2f00;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:3px;}"
